  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A water tank is filled upto height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math>&nbsp;and is being emptied through a small hole at the bottom. Ratio of time&nbsp;taken for the level of water to fall from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>to zero is</p>\r"
  },
